{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","虚妄回响"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身的最大生命值降低，以此为代价额外布置一个可以释放技能的幻象。主动使用时对周围敌人造成伤害，并为自身恢复生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，普鲁斯托的最大生命值降低12%，但玩家在备战时可以额外布置一个以假乱真的幻象。幻象继承普鲁斯托100%属性，且可以使用全部技能。当本体与幻象布阵在同一行时，双方将会获得30%减伤效果，持续至其中一方被击败。\n主动使用时，对周围2格范围内的所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，每命中一个敌人为自身恢复160% + 15% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":133,"end":139,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":162,"end":168,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":129,"end":143,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":158,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的伤害提高至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的伤害提高至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的伤害提高至320% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的伤害提高至360% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","深红契约"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，本体与幻象各自与身后友军签订契约。战斗中主动释放时，对面前的一名敌人造成三次伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，本体和幻象各自对布阵在其身后一格的一名英雄签订永久契约，并扣除其6%当前生命值。本体将使契约者永久提升14%能量获取速度，幻象将使契约者永久提高14%伤害减免。契约的具体效果在战斗开始前不对敌人可见。\n战斗中主动使用时，对面前的一名敌人进行三次攻击，前两击造成100% + 10% ATK伤害，第三击造成140% + 20% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":140,"end":146,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":162,"end":168,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backonehex"},{"start":136,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":158,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中主动使用时，本体会使契约者额外获得80点能量；幻象会使契约者获得180% ATK护盾，持续6秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中主动使用时，第三击的伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","战斗中主动使用时，第三击的伤害提高至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","恶毒蛰刺"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人施加“禁忌蝎毒”，使其不断流失生命并降低属性。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","用钩尾蛰刺面前的一名敌人，对其造成50% ATK伤害并施加“禁忌蝎毒”，持续6秒。受“禁忌蝎毒”影响的敌人降低30点急速和45点受愈，每秒流失2% + 0.4%最大生命值，并使“禁忌蝎毒”的施加者每秒恢复3%最大生命值。敌人每秒流失的生命值最高不超过普鲁斯托攻击力的40%。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":73,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","敌人每秒流失的生命值提高至2.5% + 0.4%最大生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“禁忌蝎毒”的施加者每秒恢复的最大生命值比例提高至4.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","敌人每秒流失的生命值提高至3.3% + 0.4%最大生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","本体和幻象的护甲与魔抗提高。当其中一方损失生命时，使另一方获得能量。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","本体和幻象的护甲与魔抗提高30%。每当其中一方累计损失10%最大生命值，将会使另一方获得15点能量。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本体和幻象的护甲与魔抗提高40%。每当其中一方累计损失10%最大生命值，将会使另一方获得20点能量。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本体和幻象的护甲与魔抗提高50%。每当其中一方累计损失10%最大生命值，将会使另一方获得25点能量。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","雾中呢喃"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","幻象先于本体被击败时，对一名敌人造成伤害和眩晕效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若幻象先于本体被击败，则普鲁斯托会嘲弄累计对幻象造成伤害最高的敌人，对其造成500% ATK伤害和4.5秒眩晕。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害提高至600% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害提高至700% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","若幻象先于本体被击败，则普鲁斯托会重新在自己身前召唤一个新的幻象，该幻象只继承本体60%最大生命值。本效果每场战斗最多触发1次。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","本体与幻象布阵在同一行时，开局将会获得一个临时护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当本体与幻象布阵在同一行时，双方将会在战斗开始时获得相当于自身攻击力570%的护盾，持续12秒。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","诡雾斗"]]}